{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23728","headline":"认春戏呈冯少尹李郎中陈主簿 · 白居易","name":"认春戏呈冯少尹李郎中陈主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"认得春风先到处，西园南面水东头。\n柳初变後条犹重，花未开时枝已稠。\n闇助醉欢寻绿酒，潜添睡兴着红楼。\n知君未别阳和意，直待春深始拟游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}